{"id":463,"name":"lickilicky","speciesId":463,"dex":463,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["normal"],"stats":{"hp":110,"attack":85,"defense":95,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":95,"speed":50},"abilities":[{"name":"own-tempo","hidden":false},{"name":"oblivious","hidden":false},{"name":"cloud-nine","hidden":true}],"height":17,"weight":1400,"baseExp":180,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/463.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/463.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/463.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/463.ogg","genus":"Licking Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool."},{"version":"platinum","text":"The long tongue is always soggy with slobber. The saliva contains a solvent that causes numbness."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Its saliva can decompose anything. It wraps its long tongue around things to coat them with its sticky saliva."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"It has space in its throat to store saliva. It can also roll up its tongue and store it in the same spot."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Their saliva contains lots of components that can dissolve anything. The numbness caused by their lick does not dissipate."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"A contest is under way to determine which one can stick its tongue out the farthest. The current record is...more than 82 feet."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It uses its tongue much more skillfully than its hands or its feet. It can deftly pick up a single small bean with its tongue."},{"version":"sword","text":"Lickilicky’s strange tongue can stretch to many times the length of its body. No one has figured out how Lickilicky’s tongue can stretch so far."},{"version":"shield","text":"Lickilicky can do just about anything with its tongue, which is as dexterous as the human hand. In contrast, Lickilicky’s use of its fingers is clumsy."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its tongue can extend and contract freely, and it is capable of reaching lengths over 10 times Lickilicky's height. Beware of the saliva, as it contains corrosive elements."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":30,"eggGroups":["monster"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"lickitung","speciesId":108,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Sabendo Rollout"],"species":"lickilicky","speciesId":463,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":463,"name":"lickilicky","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/463.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,20,23,24],"moves":[{"id":5,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":7,"learn":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":8,"learn":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":9,"learn":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":14,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":15,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":20,"learn":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":21,"learn":[[8,"lv",29],[9,"lv",29],[10,"lv",29],[11,"lv",29],[14,"lv",29],[15,"lv",29],[16,"lv",29],[17,"lv",29],[18,"lv",29],[20,"lv",48],[23,"lv",48]]},{"id":23,"learn":[[8,"lv",21],[9,"lv",21],[10,"lv",21],[11,"lv",21],[14,"lv",21],[15,"lv",21],[16,"lv",21],[17,"lv",21],[18,"lv",21],[20,"lv",30],[23,"lv",30]]},{"id":25,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[24,"lv",1]]},{"id":3